        "id": "intro",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Sci-fi Game Model Starter Pack\n\nReusable sci-fi GLB models: a scout robot with an idle animation, a drone, cargo, crystals, and modular station pieces. Run to expose each model as a named output. No provider or API key required.\n\nModels use meters, Y up, forward -Z, and ground-level origins. Station pieces use a 2 m grid. These are visual assets, so add gameplay colliders separately. Download a model from its preview and upload it to your project before importing it into a 3D game. Keep the model on a visual child of the physics root. The robot has an Idle clip, with no skeleton or locomotion clips."
        },
